  "type_pretty": "∀ (n : ℕ → ℕ),\n  StrictMono n →\n    (∀ t ≥ 1, Filter.limsup (fun k => ↑(↑(n k) / ↑k.succ ^ t)) Filter.atTop = ⊤) →\n      Transcendental ℚ (∑' (k : ℕ), 1 / 2 ^ n k)"
